The `f2/` directory in this repository is a vendored copy of f2 0.0.1.7 with
local modifications:

  * weibo Live Photo (livephoto) video download support
  * download requests now follow HTTP redirects
  * Bark push notification disabled by default
  * incomplete downloads are no longer silently finalized: a network error
    mid-download keeps the `.tmp` part-file (for breakpoint resume), marks
    the task failed and fails the process so the orchestrator (f2dl) retries
    the whole task and resumes the interrupted file
  * douyin user-post listing is fetched directly through a real-Firefox
    channel (Playwright, `apps/douyin/browser_fetch.py`): the page's own JS
    signs the request in a genuine browser environment and Python only taps
    the responses. Headless is preferred with an automatic headed retry;
    the httpx channel remains as the last-resort fallback. Scrolling is
    fully automatic: 5-15s random CD per page, posture-rotating retries,
    auto session renewal (up to 5x, cross-session dedup) until the
    incremental window is covered, per-item stop at the last_run moment,
    and a 30-minute total budget as a runaway fuse. The post mode also
    derives the user folder from the works list itself, skipping the
    profile endpoint entirely (O3); the Playwright browser instance is
    kept alive across sessions within a process (W1)
    (verified 2026-09-15, see `probe_browser_post.py` /
    `verify_browser_filter.py`)

